00:07:50,769 --> 00:07:56,769
The Wild Robot is a animation, science fiction,
family film directed by Chris Sanders.

3
00:11:46,153 --> 00:11:52,153
After a shipwreck, an intelligent robot called Roz is
stranded on an uninhabited island.

4
00:15:41,538 --> 00:15:47,538
To survive the harsh environment, Roz bonds with the island's
animals and cares for an orphaned baby goose.

5
