Roz / Rummage (voice), played by Lupita Nyong'o.

6
00:23:32,307 --> 00:23:38,307
Fink (voice), played by Pedro Pascal.

7
00:27:27,692 --> 00:27:33,692
Brightbill (voice), played by Kit Connor.

8
